WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.588 --> 00:00:04.053
KATY
What happened to your shirt?

00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:07.744
SHANG-CHI
All I ever wanted,

00:00:07.745 --> 00:00:09.000
was a normal life.

00:00:10.132 --> 00:00:11.052
WENWU
My son.

00:00:11.627 --> 00:00:12.858
The ten rings...

00:00:14.032 --> 00:00:16.266
gave our family
legendary power.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:21.437
Show me you’re strong enough
to carry that.

00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:32.265
SHANG-CHI
I’m nothing like you.

00:00:35.514 --> 00:00:36.971
SHANG-CHI
I thought I could change my name.

00:00:40.066 --> 00:00:40.841
 Start a new life.

00:00:41.687 --> 00:00:44.052
WENWU
You can’t outrun your destiny.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:51.385
SHANG-CHI
I’m not afraid of you.

